# device-* media queries come from one place (DisplayUtil::DisplayToScreenInfo);
# devicePixelRatio is the persona DPR applied as the forced device scale factor
# in every process; new browser windows are clamped to the persona's available
# area so outerWidth/outerHeight <= availWidth/availHeight; window.screenX/Y
# are relative to the display's work area, clamped into the persona's
